min}}=-4,$ and the value of $x$ that minimizes $f(x)$ is ${x}_{\\text{min}}=4.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-d65b68cd-44fe-525c-bfeb-caea3373b3e3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-d65b68cd-44fe-525c-bfeb-caea3373b3e3" :answer-field/id #uuid "d65b68cd-44fe-525c-bfeb-caea3373b3e3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-7bfa8155-3c5a-57cf-aa28-23ff73257326" :answer-field/choices ["answer-10b64010-1aad-525c-a643-83c025278cfc" "answer-7bfa8155-3c5a-57cf-aa28-23ff73257326" "answer-8505f759-4149-5bf6-ab53-8f74686ad96b" "answer-531fd7eb-5005-586b-9cde-b6aaf6bb72fe" "answer-9ea34fee-19fb-5ba9-8775-891452be3904"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-10b64010-1aad-525c-a643-83c025278cfc" :answer/id #uuid "10b64010-1aad-525c-a643-83c025278cfc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7bfa8155-3c5a-57cf-aa28-23ff73257326" :answer/id #uuid "7bfa8155-3c5a-57cf-aa28-23ff73257326" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8505f759-4149-5bf6-ab53-8f74686ad96b" :answer/id #uuid "8505f759-4149-5bf6-ab53-8f74686ad96b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-531fd7eb-5005-586b-9cde-b6aaf6bb72fe" :answer/id #uuid "531fd7eb-5005-586b-9cde-b6aaf6bb72fe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9ea34fee-19fb-5ba9-8775-891452be3904" :answer/id #uuid "9ea34fee-19fb-5ba9-8775-891452be3904" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-1b07da73-507b-5a7d-831e-9986becac517" :question/id #uuid "1b07da73-507b-5a7d-831e-9986becac517" :question/math-academy-id "q-342847" :question/problem "![](images/39/393c612a7ecb682e28bf9de46024a3681e8f6e58a9add78c0b24a870aa00fa7a.png)\n\nThe function $f(x)$ is defined and differentiable on $[0,4].$ The graph of ${f}^{′}(x),$ the derivative of $f(x),$ is shown above, where the area of the region between the graph and the $x$-axis is $8.$ Find the minimum value of $f(x)$ on the interval $[0,4]$ given that $f(0)=-1.$\n\n${f}_{\\text{min}}=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "According to the candidates test, the minimum value of $f(x)$ on $[0,4]$ must occur at a critical point or an endpoint of the interval.\n\n**Step 1**: Find the critical points:\n\nWe see that ${f}^{′}(x)$ is defined everywhere on $x\\in (0,4),$ and ${f}^{′}(x)\\ne 0$ on this interval. Therefore, the candidates are $x=0,4.$\n\n**Step 2**: Compute the value of $f$ for each candidate using the fundamental theorem of calculus:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(0) & =-1 \\\\ f(4) & =f(0)+{\\int }_{0}^{4}{f}^{′}(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-1+(-8) \\\\  & =-9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Step 3**: Select the smallest value of $f$ from our candidates.\n\nComparing the values of $f$ found in step $2,$ we have\n\n$$\n{f}_{\\text{min}}=min\\{-1,-9\\}=-9.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the minimum value of $f$ is ${f}_{\\text{min}}=-9,$ and the value of $x$ that minimizes $f(x)$ is ${x}_{\\text{min}}=4.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-0d3b2238-2f4b-5f46-852b-25cc3958669c"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-0d3b2238-2f4b-5f46-852b-25cc3958669c" :answer-field/id #uuid "0d3b2238-2f4b-5f46-852b-25cc3958669c" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-fb8c2326-431f-5feb-b9b6-755c7c458e57" :answer-field/choices ["answer-fb8c2326-431f-5feb-b9b6-755c7c458e57"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fb8c2326-431f-5feb-b9b6-755c7c458e57" :answer/id #uuid "fb8c2326-431f-5feb-b9b6-755c7c458e57" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-e788b4b9-a09c-5261-9e6a-52c70